  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting the Africa-Led Movement to end Female Genital Mutilation (FGM) Ph2: Technical Support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This second phase will continue to work with others to support a movement within countries and globally to raise awareness and understanding of Female Genital Mutilation/Cutting (FGM/C) and build support for efforts to end the practice</narrative>
  </description>
